Test changes in test_deadlock_detector.cpp:
1. Update `TooManyActiveMissions` (lines 119-127): expect `DeadlockKind::kOverCapacity` instead of kMutualBlock. Also update the comment maybe. Since it's an enum comparison EXPECT_EQ works with enum class? gtest can compare enum class with ==. Existing tests already do `EXPECT_EQ(findings[0].kind, DeadlockKind::kMutualBlock)`. Fine.

